  "today_branch_note": "Retail by branch/channel for Thu 20 Aug (wholesale excluded from net and ticket). <b>SQ1 &#3647;15,566 (23 bills, &#3647;677 ticket)</b> and Fashion Island &#3647;9,019 carried the day; Shopee added &#3647;3,850 and Shopify &#3647;1,093. &#9888; <b>Vending machines and TikTok posted nothing today</b>, and <b>Central Ladprao and ACT Westgate remain dark on retail for a fourth straight week.</b> Separately, <b>a &#3647;350,765 wholesale block posted today &mdash; &#3647;326,220 of it (1,444 units, 3 invoices) booked to Central Ladprao on an individual customer account (C-7495111) under the Wholesale BU.</b> It is excluded from every retail figure above; please confirm the customer account and location are correct.",
  "week_note": "<b>Retail basis</b> &mdash; wholesale / intercompany excluded (BU class 12 plus customers C-00010 and ACTIONCITY PTE). <b>W34 is week-to-date (Mon 17 &ndash; Thu 20 Aug, 4 days): &#3647;162,105, or &#3647;40,526/day against &#3647;66,573/day in W33</b> &mdash; retail is running about 39% below last week's daily pace. The same Mon&ndash;Thu window of W33 was &#3647;233,479, so like-for-like the week is &minus;30.6%. W28 remains the peak (&#3647;746,877). Online orders keep posting for several days, so W34 will rise somewhat.",
  "branch_note": "Last 3 complete weeks (net &#3647;; B2B shown as its own line). <b>SQ1 is still the anchor but has eased three weeks running</b> (&#3647;228.8k &rarr; &#3647;214.8k &rarr; &#3647;206.1k), and Fashion Island with it (&#3647;166.3k &rarr; &#3647;157.9k &rarr; &#3647;131.9k). <b>Vending is the one channel growing</b> (&#3647;26.4k &rarr; &#3647;33.7k &rarr; &#3647;48.8k, IconSiam 6F doing most of it) and Shopee held &#3647;60.1k. Shopify own-web dropped to &#3647;16.7k. &#9888; <b>Central Ladprao and ACT Westgate posted zero retail in all three weeks.</b> Shopify = E-Commerce BU (own web, not a marketplace).",
  "marketplace_note": "Online marketplaces (Shopee / Lazada / TikTok), retail only. <b>Shopee is the steady online engine &mdash; &#3647;60,109 in W33 across 99 orders</b>, with &#3647;40,669 already booked in the 4 days of W34. TikTok is small but has restarted (&#3647;2,430 / 6 orders in W33, &#3647;3,779 WTD). <b>Lazada has posted nothing in all three weeks.</b> Shopify own-web sits in the business-unit view above, not here.",
  "cat_note": "Trailing 4 weeks (24 Jul &ndash; 20 Aug), all channels. <b>Collectables margin has fallen to 39.3%</b> on just 41 units across 16 SKUs &mdash; premium figures are barely moving and at &#3647;3,349 ASP every miss is expensive. The rest of the range holds 46.5% GP on 8,112 units. <b>Both lines now sit below the 50% GP line</b>, which is worth a pricing pass.",
  "reorder_note": "Retail velocity, W30&ndash;W33 full weeks plus W34 to date (4 days, so the W34 column understates). <b>Cat Hug Plush Keychain is tightest at 22 units / 1.0 week cover</b> and <b>Upset Duck Stop The Spiral at 38 units / 1.5 weeks</b> &mdash; both reorder now. Picoco Cat is a small buy at 2.2 weeks. Fuggler Heart Care Bear has faded (30 units in W33 to 3 WTD) &mdash; watch it before rebuying.",
  "top_w1_label": "W32",
