  "top_note": "Retail only, last 2 complete weeks (W32 + W33); wholesale and intercompany excluded. <b>Fuggler Keyboard Cap dominates at 444 units / &#3647;82.7k net, but cooled from 298 to 146 units</b> and its 43.0% GP is the weakest among the leaders. Every GP% below 50 is flagged red. Wholesale over the same two weeks was &#3647;224,865 / 950 units / 39 SKUs across 7 orders, and &#3647;365,622 / 1,590 units week-to-date in W34 &mdash; all excluded above.",
